  }
  /* A gadget's shortcode *is* its text content, so it stays visible until the
     rail paints over it — and a row parked below the fold can sit there for
     seconds. Stash and blank rail shortcodes up front; plain HTML widgets are
     left completely alone so their markup survives. */
